    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I reproduced this on latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nHello @echasnovski, I'm trying to copy/yank text from neovim and cannot paste it outside of neovim or copy some text outside of neovim and cannot paste inside of it.\n\nIn the past I've used kickstart.nvim and did not face such issue.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nInstall Sway & wl-clipboard\nInstall MiniMax\nTry copy pasting functionality",
