            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nCan you, please, describe how you try to copy and paste?\n\nBy default simple yanking doesn't affect system clipboard (as I find it not quite clean). So instead there are dedicated `gy` and `gp` mappings (created by 'mini.basics') for yanking and pasting using system clipboard.\n\nDoes it work for you if you use them instead of plain `y` and `p`?",
