        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks indeed `gy` and `gp` does what I intend. Clearly I haven't read the comments properly.\n\nI have another issue, in `plugin/40_plugins.lua`, I have added `'c'` and `'cpp'` in the list of `ensure_languages` of `nvim-treesitter`. After I restart nvim, treesitter does try to install `'c'` and `'cpp`' highlighters but it's stuck in:\n```\n[nvim-treesitter/install/cpp]: Compiling parser\n```\nAnd If I start another neovim instance it happens there as well, won't they interfere?\n\nThanks.",
